# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your real .env file or hardcode API keys in source files.
#
# Option 1 (Free Prototyping - No Billing Required):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
#   3. Click to generate/reveal your free Maps Demo Key (supports Maps JS, Places New, Routes, Geocoding).
#   4. Copy .env.example to .env and paste your key below.
#
# Option 2 (Production):
#   Create and restrict a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   with Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Geocoding API enabled.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
PORT=3000
